armacology"},"uses":{"text":"α-Pyrrolidinohexiophenone (α-PHP, A-PHP, Aphp, alpha-PHP, α-Pyrrolidinohexanophenone, PV-7) is a synthetic stimulant drug of the cathinone class developed in the 1960s which has been reported as a novel designer drug.","source":"Wikipedia","page":"Α-Pyrrolidinohexiophenone","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%CE%91-Pyrrolidinohexiophenone","routes":"Oral, intranasal, vaporization, intravenous, rectal, sublingual, subcutaneous","figures":"Α-Pyrrolidinohexiophenone"},"summaryZh":"α-吡咯烷基苯己酮（英語：α-Pyrrolidinohexiophenone，縮寫：α-PHP，或稱為：1-苯基-2-(N-吡咯烷基)-1-己酮、PV-7）是一種含氮有機化合物，分子式C16H23NO，屬於卡西酮衍生物，1960年代研發，2015年列入《非藥用類麻醉藥品和精神藥品名錄》。"}